ph view, its edge positions: a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stored or computed row (shifted by a constant), or a contiguous range. Random access,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"O(1) per element.","type":"text"}]}}}